#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\nthat dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the wire. Both carry the\nelevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure builders live in\n`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring against the token sheet\nalone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files at\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr ""

