msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr ""

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr ""

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr ""

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
