msgid "# Variable: progress"
msgstr ""

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress>` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr ""

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. `variant` maps the\ncomponent to `-color-<variant>` and `label` supplies its accessible name."
msgstr ""

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
