msgid "`<instui-progress-circle>` — a circular indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr ""

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to animate from zero on mount; `animation-delay` is a millisecond delay.\n`label` overrides the accessible name (which otherwise defaults to the percentage)."
msgstr ""

